# 第16章 典型问题与解题模板
## 16.1 双指针技巧
```java
// 对撞双指针
public int[] twoSum(int[] numbers, int target) {    int left = 0, right = numbers.length - 1;    while (left < right) {        int sum = numbers[left] + numbers[right];        if (sum == target) return new int[]{left + 1, right + 1};        else if (sum < target) left++;        else right--;    }    return null;}// 滑动窗口public int minSubArrayLen(int target, int[] nums) {    int left = 0, sum = 0, minLen = Integer.MAX_VALUE;    for (int right = 0; right < nums.length; right++) {        sum += nums[right];        while (sum >= target) {            minLen = Math.min(minLen, right - left + 1);            sum -= nums[left++];        }    }    return minLen == Integer.MAX_VALUE ? 0 : minLen;}// 快慢指针public boolean hasCycle(ListNode head) {    ListNode slow = head, fast = head;    while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {        slow = slow.next; fast = fast.next.next;        if (slow == fast) return true;    }    return false;}```## 16.2 滑动窗口
